    "detailed_description": "This is a single search for clues to solve the mystery story game, the protagonist of the game called Lucy, is a beautiful detective, there is a house in the home of the mistress of a murder, her daughter died in the bathroom, so she found you, hoping you can investigate the cause here. There's a bit of a mystery here, because there was no second person in the bathroom besides the victim, and there was no sign of a struggle. So it could have been a suicide, but the daughter was in a good state of mind and had a new boyfriend who loved her, so she couldn't have killed herself. That's where our pretty detective comes in.<br><br>Game Features:<br>\u2666 Warm scene, beautiful music.<br>\u2666 Authentic experience, immersive story.<br>\u2666 Beautiful girl, smart mind.<br>\u2666 Realistic operation, Shikoku language.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837140/extras/b76fa26af592bcd76bcdead660bfd4ca.avif?t=1746792628\" width=468 height=602 /></span><br><br>Game play:<br>\u2666 WSAD controls the movement of the protagonist and the mouse controls the rotation of the camera.<br>\u2666 YUIOP five buttons can be switched to different national languages.<br>\u2666 In the game dialogue, click the left mouse button to open the next dialogue.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837140/extras/ada2f57986666b292ec3c203256e6770.avif?t=1746792628\" width=338 height=470 /></span>",
